    "differences": [
      "8-bit CISC accumulator-based CPU vs 32-bit ARM Cortex-M RISC CPU",
      "Big-endian multi-byte data storage vs little-endian ARM default",
      "24-bit linear flat address space vs 32-bit segmented memory map",
      "Vector table anchored at 0x008000 with 4-byte 0x82 JPF opcode entries vs VTOR at 0x00000000/0x08000000 with Initial SP + Thumb entry points",
      "Page zero 8-bit MMIO peripherals at 0x005000-0x0057FF vs 32-bit APB/AHB bus mapped registers at 0x40000000+",
      "ST SPL / Reference manual register definitions vs ARM CMSIS-SVD schemas"
    ]
  },
